{"unit_id":"BruceLanLan__dsh-tier-router#card-zh","repo":"BruceLanLan/dsh-tier-router","commit":"6c388142e4c2afc95c65ed068474c8ec3bb20cb5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tier-router 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型路由插件，可让会话按计划阶段使用强档或便宜档模型。它在 agent 会话中注册路由工具、斜杠命令和提示说明，并提供 Web 设置面板。主要功能包括计划模式自动切换、按会话手动选择档位、模型回退与失败升级、强档顾问和代码评审，以及按档位派发子代理。适合希望控制不同任务模型成本、为复杂工作保留较强模型的 DSH 用户。使用前需要在 DSH 中配置可用的模型 provider；插件自身不要求额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-120","lib/index.js:892-923","lib/index.js:925-963","client/client.js:601-629"]}
{"unit_id":"BruceLanLan__dsh-tier-router#card-en","repo":"BruceLanLan/dsh-tier-router","commit":"6c388142e4c2afc95c65ed068474c8ec3bb20cb5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tier-router routes DSH web sessions between strong and cheaper models. It adds plan-aware switching, per-session controls, fallback and failure escalation, advisor and review tools, tiered subagents, and a Web settings panel. Configure model providers in DSH; no separate API key is defined.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-120","lib/index.js:892-923","lib/index.js:925-963","client/client.js:601-629"]}
